<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective Feb 26.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     22.88     23.29	  4.86-10.09 4.66-9.89</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     22.88     23.29	  4.67-9.66  4.46-9.46</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     26.84     25.66	  11.81	12.44</p>
<p> White sugar	  26.84     25.66	  7.29	 7.88</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.27	0.26	  0.38	 0.39</p>
</text>
